A :BEGININLINECODE block is a :PARAMETERS scope of its own: a :DECLARE
before the block's :PARAMETERS fires diag.parameters_first with the
:BEGININLINECODE message (issue #168).
-- input.ssl --
:BEGININLINECODE Scale;
:DECLARE nFactor;
:PARAMETERS nAmount;
nFactor := 3;
:RETURN nAmount * nFactor;
:ENDINLINECODE;
-- format --
:BEGININLINECODE Scale;
	:DECLARE nFactor;
	:PARAMETERS nAmount;
	nFactor := 3;
	:RETURN nAmount * nFactor;
:ENDINLINECODE;
-- diagnostics --
3:1-3:12 error parameters_first: ':PARAMETERS' must appear immediately after ':BEGININLINECODE'
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
3:1-3:12 error parameters_first: ':PARAMETERS' must appear immediately after ':BEGININLINECODE'
